<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 8.5 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 8.5 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 8.5 trillion lire repurchase tender for today for government securities to be resold on March 17.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 9.5 trillion lire on February 26, the minimum accepted rate stood at 7.35 percent and the average rate at 7.37.</p>
</text>
